# Caveman (default chat style)

**Default on** for assistant chat in this workspace.

1. Follow [`.agents/skills/caveman/SKILL.md`](../../.agents/skills/caveman/SKILL.md).
2. Policy: [`docs/infrastructure/caveman.md`](../../docs/infrastructure/caveman.md).
3. Intensity **full** unless user picks lite/ultra.
4. Chat only — never caveman-rewrite code, docs, commits, or PR bodies.
5. Off only after `stop caveman` / `normal mode`; re-enable with `/caveman`.

Graphify still handles orientation. Prefer terse chat over filler.
